   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "On the *Folgers* test shot this step comes within \u0394E 1.34 of the approved result (pass mark 1.5). Run-to-run variation at a fixed seed is small but not zero, and an int8 model on a different card will not be bit-identical."
   ],
